<title>USA: PROFIT FINANCIAL APPROVES STOCK SPLIT.</title>
<headline>PROFIT FINANCIAL APPROVES STOCK SPLIT.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profit Financial Corp said its board of directors approved a three-for-one stock split, effective September 15 to holders of record September 1.</p>
<p>The company said the board also approved a name change to Wade Cook Financial Inc, subject to shareholder approval at the October 14 shareholders' meeting.</p>
